  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and garlic, cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add artichoke hearts, roasted red peppers, and Kalamata olives, cook until heated through, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in dashi extract, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Shred Manchego cheese and add to the wok, cook until melted and crispy, about 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in crumbled feta cheese, cook until melted and well combined.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer to a serving dish, garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
